<title>USA: Birmingham Steel Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Birmingham Steel Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p> Revenues			    $257,858,000	$197,057,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			594,000	(14,397,000)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share		  .02		 (.50)</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	29,422,682	  28,597,852</p>
<p>					    Nine Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						  1997		  1996</p>
<p> Revenues			     701,420,000	 601,707,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		   12,862,000	 (5,563,000)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share		  .45		 (.19)</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	28,896,416	  28,552,097</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarters included start-up costs of $6.6 million, or $0.50/shr, vs writeoffs of $16.3 million.</p>
<p>Nine month net includes costs of $9.1 million vs writeoffs of $21.4 million. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
